    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In the viral circus of early 2025, the content creator's monetization scheme unraveled when Seoul police secured an arrest warrant. The viral hoaxer had fabricated a digital farce using AI-generated audio and manipulated screenshots, claiming the celebrity dated a minor co-star. This professional impact on the actor's career was a direct consequence of the scandal, halting endorsements as the court performers prepared their case.",
