    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The online provocateur turned the capital city into a stage for misinformation, using digital manipulation to stage a hoax. By spreading misinformation for financial gain, the individual drew the attention of law enforcement. Authorities intervened with an arrest warrant issuance, leading to the arrest and detention of the clown, a consequence of crime that punctured the absurdity of the fabricated tale.",
